        <mxCell id="in_text" value="• Vehicle Inventory Records (Taxis, Vans, MPVs, Traysikels, EVs)&#10;&#10;• Active Driver Profile Roster &amp; License Credentials&#10;&#10;• Real-Time Telematics Sensors (GPS lat/lng, Speed km/h, Idling time)&#10;&#10;• Fuel &amp; Energy Market Rates (Gasoline ₱/L, Diesel ₱/L, EV ₱/kWh)&#10;&#10;• Terminal Hub Coordinates (Manila Port, BGC, NAIA, Davao Hubs)&#10;&#10;• Inter-System API Data (HRMS, Payroll, CRM)&#10;&#10;• System Requirements (RA 10173 Privacy, ISO/IEC 25010 Quality)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4C0519;" vertex="1" parent="box_input">
