        <mxCell id="pr_text" value="• Agile Scrum Software Development Lifecycle (2-Week Sprints)&#10;&#10;• Full-Stack Laravel/PHP Portal Engineering &amp; RESTful APIs&#10;&#10;• Supervised Machine Learning Model Training (XGBoost / Random Forest)&#10;&#10;• Leaflet.js GPS Mapping &amp; Telemetry Simulation Engine&#10;&#10;• Automated Eco-Safety Score Calculation (100% Penalty System)&#10;&#10;• Transport Cost Analysis (CPK &amp; Profit Margin Engine)&#10;&#10;• Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) &amp; Bcrypt Encryption&#10;&#10;• ISO/IEC 25010 Quality Product Evaluation" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4C0519;" vertex="1" parent="box_process">
