        <mxCell id="out_text" value="• Centralized Hirna Fleet &amp; Transportation Management System&#10;&#10;• Automated Dispatch &amp; Leaflet GPS Telemetry Engine&#10;&#10;• AI Fuel Consumption &amp; Energy Predictor (kWh / Liters)&#10;&#10;• Real-Time Driver Eco-Safety Scorecards &amp; Incident Alerts&#10;&#10;• Transport Cost Analysis (TCAO) Financial Dashboard&#10;&#10;• Exportable CSV Reports &amp; Printable PDF Audit Summaries&#10;&#10;• Enterprise RESTful API Integration (HRMS, Payroll, CRM)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4C0519;" vertex="1" parent="box_output">
